              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The USER study was an action reserach project around the implementation of patient-reported outcome measures and experience measures (PROM and PREM) in perinatal care. Data generation included:\n-\tSurvey amongst participating care professionals regarding the implementation process\n-\tFocus groups with care professionals working with the PROM and PREM in pactice and in quality improvement\n-\tObservations of project team meetings during the implementation period\nThe dataset consists of quantitative survey data and qualitative data from all sources, merged in one document as text fields."
                },
